{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0284_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2edaec0d42b0053ae9a00d56e908317352111375e96018ffc146e46935a16069", "ja": "風花、今回の衣装はどうだ？　元看護師の\n視点から、遠慮なく感想を聞かせてほしいな。", "zh": "风花，这次的服装怎么样？希望你能从前护士的角度出发，不用客气，告诉我真实感想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0284_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "2dc5bac2ad63fad269f0360c42558dcd68f5875a4159983efe032314de70997d", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん。とっても\nかわいいナース服、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。谢谢您送我这么可爱的护士服♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0284_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ba4faa0fb4514099eb673489229422a0769296ba7ed3e2bbb3dd7eb5984a9b5b", "ja": "ちゃんとアイドル衣装になってますけど……\nやっぱり、病院に勤めていた頃を思い出しますね。", "zh": "确实是偶像服装没错，可是……\n果然还是会想起以前在医院工作的时候呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0284_1003_p", "source_sha256": "83dbc5c48a54f38f51e4fe9ca48e6bafdaa60cb1aea47f8a7a1e79d02dd383b4", "ja": "ははっ。アレンジしてあっても、\nやっぱり思い出しちゃうものなんだな。", "zh": "哈哈。就算经过改编，还是会不由得想起来啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0284_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "31a77d4115aab876d5425eee00274644aee041588f024934864b7c2ea64b73e2", "ja": "そうですね。こういう服を着ると、\nどうしてもスイッチが入ってしまうというか……。", "zh": "是啊。穿上这样的衣服，总觉得不由自主就进入状态了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0284_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c57886e75025c1a98c551220313510ff2fd796f8d96da79b4d794ba3d32d2863", "ja": "動きやすいように髪をあげるのも、当時は\nよくやってたので……なおさらかもしれません。", "zh": "为了方便活动把头发扎起来，当时也经常这么做……所以可能就更有感觉了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0284_1006_p", "source_sha256": "432c420ab02000ac44f0264122d41237550484320ba2f4cecd38d6ac5d024531", "ja": "そうか。新鮮に感じていたけど\n風花にとっては馴染みのある髪型なんだな。", "zh": "这样啊。我觉得很新鲜，但对风花来说，这是很熟悉的发型吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0284_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6b38ad1df93a54bd6243f46598ae7ec38858c7bd2614afd0dde7fad7179162b0", "ja": "はい、お見せする機会はなかったですもんね。\nこの髪型で院内をバタバタ駆けまわって……。", "zh": "是啊，毕竟一直没机会让您看到嘛。\n我以前还留着这个发型，在医院里忙忙碌碌地跑来跑去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0284_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ffa021d00e9a744e6595ad1f659fb862d0258a88f2650b09c501d0487c20851f", "ja": "あの頃はいろいろなことがあったなぁ。楽しいことも\nたくさんありましたけど、思い出すのは……。", "zh": "那时候真的经历了好多事啊。虽然也有很多\n开心的事，但回想起来的却是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0284_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ffe647f877c0cffe15890d46e1d43c6e83165387928a826eb5c36c382bcdda6c", "ja": "やっぱり、困ったことかもしれません。なかなか\n言うことを聞いてくれない患者さんとか……。", "zh": "果然还是那些难办的事呢。比如总是不肯\n听话的病人什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0284_1010_p", "source_sha256": "a638a4db36f6deb0358189b800688eea035bf288ce088723a77deab000c6ba9f", "ja": "病院はいろんな人が来るだろうからなぁ。\n対応も大変だったんじゃないか？", "zh": "医院会有各种各样的人来吧。\n应对起来也很不容易吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0284_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "2cb2b4ebb9b59dccb96688c902a6e0cf2783a8c2b65ae9575ec169eeeb144a62", "ja": "ええ。でも、お話するうちに打ち解けることが\nできましたから。今となってはいい思い出です♪", "zh": "是的。不过，在聊天的过程中，我们渐渐熟悉起来了。所以现在回想起来，也是一段美好的回忆♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0284_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4534b992de62495e825296ef0e0fa17b7b43b437febeff9d8cd8f3f761c1f02c", "ja": "あ。でも、{$P$}さんと\nそういう困った患者さんは似たところがあるかも……？", "zh": "啊。不过，{$P$}先生和那种让人伤脑筋的患者，说不定有相似的地方……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0284_1013_p", "source_sha256": "2fd6b20157d4fdeb0dca39e06ae14e7f7a00e265174e81bec77b71604c2eec34", "ja": "えっ！？\nそれは、いったいどこが……。", "zh": "诶！？\n那到底是哪里像……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0284_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "90fc45e1bb469787ac241397d52c85de34d3b3779a8157529e2a52a4d9d3cb77", "ja": "頑張り過ぎなところです！　最近ちゃんと寝て\nいますか？　顔色があまりよくないですけど……。", "zh": "就是太过努力了！最近有好好睡觉吗？您的脸色好像不太好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0284_1015_p", "source_sha256": "aa2286c17a97c5df8e59dcafaa2c6b9aec212566424532d50b9d1cf933f931e6", "ja": "昨日はちょっと仕事で遅くまで……。\nでも、帰ってしっかり寝たぞ。大丈夫だ！", "zh": "昨天工作上的事弄得有点晚……\n不过，回去之后好好睡了一觉。没问题的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0284_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "2374df8d72dbeec6a351de877bcd5108eb8d74ec7add41511eff6945e40c42f5", "ja": "本当ですか？　でも、それにしては……。\nあっ、もしかして朝ごはんを抜いたりしたんじゃ……？", "zh": "真的吗？可是，即便如此……  \n啊，难道你没吃早饭……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0284_1017_p", "source_sha256": "cc02c6b3f950e3c4ed807cb0848547d9164014e632de2b78b83c5c07c281698d", "ja": "そ、それは……ちょっと朝は、\n食べる時間がなくて……。", "zh": "那、那个……只是早上有点……没有时间吃饭……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0284_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b8abaf31d6970764f68b554fac3c9f5412c9fa377aba6f58698f2bd3faec5bb7", "ja": "ほら。そんな感じで、全然言うことを聞いてくれない\n患者さんって多くて……もう困っちゃいます！", "zh": "你看，就有很多这样的患者，完全不听话……真是让人伤脑筋！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0284_1019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "91a57daa07b8e8d25cc8d4094060ed86ef703a7df5811d85357d6a3ab18d6e59", "ja": "この衣装の時は、{$P$}さんの健康を\nしっかり管理しますから！　覚悟してくださいね？", "zh": "穿这身服装时，我会好好管理{$P$}先生的健康！请做好心理准备哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0284_1020_p", "source_sha256": "4dc3977cc36dec0051751b8981446f88cf7b0ba707e56840045702862a2eee8d", "ja": "（風花のスイッチ、完全に入ってしまったようだ。\nナース風衣装の威力、恐るべしだな……！）", "zh": "（风花的开关似乎已经完全打开了。护士风服装的威力，真是不得了啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
